At Flix, we offer a dynamic work environment with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a tech-driven approach to making travel more accessible, sustainable, and affordable. &nbsp;

To strengthen our team in the Czech Republic, we are looking for a motivated and goal-oriented Shop Employee (m/f/d) for our FlixBus shop at the Florenc bus station in Prague . You will support the day-to-day running of the shop , deliver high-quality service to our passengers , and help ensure smooth operations throughout your shift . This is a full-time , permanent position , working on a shift basis across the full week , including weekdays and weekends . &nbsp;

This is a part-time role under a DPČ agreement (dohoda o pracovní činnosti) for up to 20 hours per week , for a period of 1 year, working on a shift basis across the full week, including weekdays and weekends.

About the Role

• Process ticket reservations, cancellations, and changes accurately using our sales and reservation systems &nbsp;

• Provide high-quality service to passengers, assisting with check-in and offering clear travel information &nbsp;

• Handle cash and card payments reliably, ensuring correct daily reconciliation &nbsp;

• Monitor bus departures and arrivals, and communicate any delays or changes to passengers &nbsp;

• Support smooth day-to-day station operations in coordination with colleagues and station teams &nbsp;

• Help resolve passenger questions and issues calmly and professionally during busy periods &nbsp;

About You

• Experience in customer service and cash handling &nbsp;

• Reliable, energetic, and a strong team player who contributes to a positive shift atmosphere &nbsp;

• Proactive and self-motivated, taking ownership of tasks and working independently when needed &nbsp;

• Strong communication skills &nbsp;

• Comfortable with MS Office, smartphones, web applications, and reservation systems is an advantage &nbsp;

• Flexible to work shifts from Monday to Sunday , for up to 20 hours per week

• Very good command of Czech and English ; knowledge of Ukrainian, Russian or Polish languages is an advantage &nbsp;

We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don't meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &nbsp;

What We Offer

• Travel perks : 12 free Flix vouchers + 12 discount vouchers for friends &amp; family.&nbsp;

• Benefits package: meal allowance, MultiSport card, pension contribution, private healthcare contribution, and public transport allowance &nbsp;

• Wellbeing support : Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members.&nbsp;

• Learning &amp; Development : Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills.&nbsp;

• Mentoring Program : Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career.&nbsp;

To view more local benefits specific to each office location, please check out this link:&nbsp; Locations - Flix Career

Why Join Flix?

At Flix, you’ll find teams that rally together to overcome challenges and spark creativity. We believe in ownership culture - giving you the freedom to take initiative, make an impact, and shape your own career path.
As we continue to expand across the globe, you can make a real difference in how we work.

If you’re ready to grow and lead your journey, Flix is the place for you!&nbsp;

